---
Show or rebuild the inspectable relationship profile for a contact

Usage: mxr profile [OPTIONS] <EMAIL>

Arguments:
  <EMAIL>

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>
      --rebuild
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
